{"seq":1,"slug":"inverse-kinematics","title":"反向动力学 IK","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/procedural-ik/inverse-kinematics","wordCount":1565,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"反向动力学-ik\">反向动力学 IK</h1><p><a href=\"../playback-blending/layering-masking\">分层与遮罩</a> 之后，角色已经有了一个组织良好的全身姿态，但它是&quot;录好的&quot;——脚踩在平地高度而非脚下斜坡，手摆在大致位置而非正好握住门把。反向动力学（Inverse Kinematics, IK）反过来求解：给定末端（脚、手）应当到达的目标，反推中间关节该旋转多少。它是动画对环境做出末端级精确反应的数学引擎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>正向动力学（FK）是动画的默认模式：给定每根骨的旋转，沿骨架累乘算出末端在哪。IK 是它的逆问题：给定末端目标位置（有时还有朝向），求出一组关节旋转使末端落到目标。逆问题一般是欠定的（多组解都能到达，比如手肘可以朝上也可以朝下），所以 IK 算法都要引入额外约束来挑唯一解。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[FK: 已知各关节旋转&lt;br/&gt;求末端位置] --&gt;|逆问题| B[IK: 已知末端目标&lt;br/&gt;求各关节旋转]&#10;  B --&gt; C{链长与解法}&#10;  C --&gt;|2 骨| D[解析解&lt;br/&gt;余弦定理一步求出]&#10;  C --&gt;|多骨| E[CCD&lt;br/&gt;从末端往根逐关节迭代]&#10;  C --&gt;|多骨| F[FABRIK&lt;br/&gt;前后两遍位置迭代]&#10;  D --&gt; G[加极向量约束选肘朝向]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[FK: 已知各关节旋转&lt;br/&gt;求末端位置] --&gt;|逆问题| B[IK: 已知末端目标&lt;br/&gt;求各关节旋转]\n  B --&gt; C{链长与解法}\n  C --&gt;|2 骨| D[解析解&lt;br/&gt;余弦定理一步求出]\n  C --&gt;|多骨| E[CCD&lt;br/&gt;从末端往根逐关节迭代]\n  C --&gt;|多骨| F[FABRIK&lt;br/&gt;前后两遍位置迭代]\n  D --&gt; G[加极向量约束选肘朝向]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>适用链长</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解析（两骨 IK）</td>\n<td>2 关节</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>确定唯一</td>\n<td>手臂、腿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CCD</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>易在根附近过旋</td>\n<td>触手、尾巴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FABRIK</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>平滑自然</td>\n<td>脊柱、长链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雅可比迭代</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>可控但重</td>\n<td>多目标、研究级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"两骨-ik-的解析解\">两骨 IK 的解析解</h2><p>最常用的 IK——手臂、腿——只有两根骨（如大腿—小腿—踝），存在闭式解，无需迭代。设髋到目标的距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，大腿长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、小腿长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，膝关节夹角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 由余弦定理给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\theta = \\frac{l_1^2 + l_2^2 - d^2}{2\\,l_1\\,l_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3271em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d &gt; l_1 + l_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（目标够不着）时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cos\\theta &lt; -1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，需钳制为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（腿完全伸直）。求出膝角后，再把整条腿绕髋旋转使踝对准目标。剩下的自由度——膝盖朝哪个方向弯——由<strong>极向量（pole vector）</strong> 指定：一个参考点，膝盖被约束朝向它。没有极向量，膝盖朝向会抖动甚至反折。两骨 IK 的稳定与廉价使它成为足部贴地、手部对位的首选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ccd-与-fabrik-多骨迭代解\">CCD 与 FABRIK：多骨迭代解</h2><p>超过两骨（脊柱、尾巴、触手）就没有简单闭式解，转而用迭代法。</p>\n<p><strong>CCD（Cyclic Coordinate Descent）</strong> 从末端最近的关节开始，逐个旋转每个关节使末端朝目标靠拢，一轮从末端扫到根，重复若干轮直到末端足够接近目标。它实现简单、收敛快，但容易在靠近根的关节产生过度旋转，姿态可能不自然。</p>\n<p><strong>FABRIK（Forward And Backward Reaching IK）</strong> 不在旋转空间迭代，而在位置空间：先把末端直接拉到目标，沿链向根回拉每个关节使骨长保持不变（前向遍历）；再把根拉回原位，沿链向末端推回（后向遍历）。一次前后遍历即可大幅收敛，结果通常比 CCD 更平滑自然，是现代引擎长链 IK 的主流选择。两者都需要迭代上限与误差阈值控制每帧开销——这把成本问题引向 <a href=\"../advanced-runtime/performance-lod\">性能优化与动画 LOD</a>，远处角色往往直接跳过 IK。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ik-在游戏里的真实用途\">IK 在游戏里的真实用途</h2><p>IK 不是孤立特效，而是几类高频需求的共同底座：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>足部贴地（foot IK）</strong>：向脚下投射射线得到地面高度与法线，用两骨 IK 把脚精确落到斜坡/台阶上，并旋转踝关节贴合坡面，同时调整骨盆高度避免劈叉。这是 <a href=\"procedural-animation\">程序化动画</a> 里整套足部系统的核心积木。</li>\n<li><strong>手部对位（hand IK）</strong>：让手准确握住武器、扶住墙面、攀爬时抓住边缘——尤其在 <a href=\"../foundations/animation-pipeline\">动画资产管线</a> 的重定向之后，不同体型角色的手位偏差全靠手部 IK 兜底。</li>\n<li><strong>注视（look-at）</strong>：用单关节或脊柱链 IK 让头/眼追随目标，属程序化动画范畴。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"雅可比法与多目标-ik\">雅可比法与多目标 IK</h2><p>两骨解析、CCD、FABRIK 都假设一条链奔向一个末端目标。当需要同时满足多个约束（双手各扶一处、脚贴地的同时头看向某点），就要用更通用的<strong>雅可比法</strong>。它把&quot;末端位置随各关节角度的变化率&quot;写成雅可比矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>，末端误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\mathbf{e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 与所需关节角增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\boldsymbol{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0319em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的关系近似为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>J</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\mathbf{e} = J\\,\\Delta\\boldsymbol{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0319em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，反解时用伪逆：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>J</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>J</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>J</mi><msup><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\boldsymbol{\\theta} = J^{+}\\,\\Delta\\mathbf{e}, \\qquad J^{+} = J^{\\top}(J J^{\\top})^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0319em;\">θ</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0158em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直接求逆在奇异姿态（链接近完全伸直）附近会数值爆炸，所以实际用<strong>阻尼最小二乘</strong>（DLS）加一个阻尼项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda^2 I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 稳定求解。雅可比法能优雅处理多目标与冗余自由度（用零空间投影同时满足次要目标），代价是每帧矩阵运算重、收敛慢，因此多见于研究级全身 IK 与离线工具，实时游戏里只有少数高价值角色才负担得起。这条成本与画质的取舍线，正是 <a href=\"../advanced-runtime/performance-lod\">性能优化与动画 LOD</a> 要反复权衡的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束-混合与权重\">约束、混合与权重</h2><p>裸 IK 会越过人体关节极限（膝盖反折、手腕扭断），所以每个关节要带<strong>角度约束</strong>钳制旋转范围。IK 还几乎从不&quot;全有或全无&quot;地接管：它通常以一个<strong>权重</strong>与 FK 结果混合——脚刚离地时 foot IK 权重从 1 渐隐到 0，避免抬腿瞬间突变。这套&quot;IK/FK 混合&quot;在数学上就是 <a href=\"../playback-blending/layering-masking\">分层与遮罩</a> 里的姿态插值，只不过混合的一端是算法生成而非录制的姿态。截至 2026，UE 的 Control Rig 与 Unity 的 Animation Rigging 都把这些约束、极向量、权重做成了可视化节点，让 IK 从代码下沉为美术可调的资产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>IK 是 FK 的逆问题：给定末端目标反推关节旋转，欠定故需额外约束选解。</li>\n<li>两骨 IK 有余弦定理闭式解，配极向量定肘/膝朝向，是足/手 IK 的主力。</li>\n<li>多骨链用 CCD（旋转迭代）或 FABRIK（位置迭代）；FABRIK 更平滑，是长链主流。</li>\n<li>足部贴地、手部对位、注视是 IK 的三大高频用途，也是程序化动画的积木。</li>\n<li>IK 须带关节约束防越界，并以权重与 FK 混合避免突变；现代引擎已做成可视节点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"反向动力学 IK","id":"反向动力学-ik"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两骨 IK 的解析解","id":"两骨-ik-的解析解"},{"level":2,"text":"CCD 与 FABRIK：多骨迭代解","id":"ccd-与-fabrik-多骨迭代解"},{"level":2,"text":"IK 在游戏里的真实用途","id":"ik-在游戏里的真实用途"},{"level":2,"text":"雅可比法与多目标 IK","id":"雅可比法与多目标-ik"},{"level":2,"text":"约束、混合与权重","id":"约束-混合与权重"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分层与遮罩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/playback-blending/layering-masking"},"next":{"title":"程序化动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/procedural-ik/procedural-animation"}}